Added a unified key/value Store contract in `diffsync.store.contract` with namespace isolation, a three-state `ready()` probe (ready/degraded/recovering) and a name-based backend registry. Added a resilient `RedisStore` (timeouts, reconnect, ordered WAL merge with automatic failback to in-memory storage), JSON-by-default serialization with opt-in pickle and round-trip validation, and a `store_status` command.
